OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers continue across the west but
OL,7,Ffor most a dry night with long clear
OL,8,Fspells. With mainly light winds a
OL,9,Ftouch of ground frost is possible.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FA dry, largely sunny start
OL,12,Ffor most but increasing cloud and
OL,13,Fwinds turning more northwesterly bring
OL,14,Fafternoon showers, these wintry over
OL,15,Fthe mountain tops.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
